@startuml
title Ung dung nhac lich uong thuoc va theo doi suc khoe nguoi cao tuoi
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Nguoi cao tuoi (chu ho so)" as Elder
actor "Nguoi than" as Family
actor "Quan ly van hanh" as Manager
actor "Quan tri he thong" as Admin
rectangle "He thong MedReminder" {
 usecase "Dang nhap" as Login
 usecase "Xem trang chu M01" as Home
 usecase "Xem lich uong thuoc M03" as Schedule
 usecase "Xem danh sach thuoc M04" as Meds
 usecase "Them / sua thuoc M05" as EditMed
 usecase "Xac nhan da uong" as Confirm
 usecase "Nhan thong bao nhac thuoc" as Notify
 usecase "Xem lich su va suc khoe" as History
 usecase "Quan ly ket noi nguoi than" as Connections
 usecase "Xem so lieu van hanh" as Ops
 usecase "Khoa / mo tai khoan" as Disable
 usecase "Dat lai mat khau / doi vai tro" as AdminOps
}
Elder --> Login
Elder --> Home
Elder --> Schedule
Elder --> Meds
Elder --> EditMed
Elder --> Confirm
Elder --> Notify
Elder --> History
Elder --> Connections
Family --> Login
Family --> Schedule
Family --> Meds
Family --> History
Family --> Notify
Manager --> Login
Manager --> Ops
Manager --> Disable
Admin --> Login
Admin --> Ops
Admin --> Disable
Admin --> AdminOps
note right of Family
Nguoi than can ket noi dang hoat dong va quyen phu hop.
Theo API spec, chi chu ho so duoc xac nhan da uong.
end note
note bottom of Notify
Backend node-cron gui Web Push qua Firebase Cloud Messaging.
end note
@enduml
